{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>אשר, ולא יאשמו</b> — according to their thinking." "<b>ואעשיר</b> — the vowel of the alef in it belongs to the vav; therefore it disappears like the disappearing of alef, as in ואענה את זרע דוד." "<b>ורועיהם</b> — they are the kings of the nations. And the correct interpretation in my eyes: that רועיהם is the honored Name, and this is correct, and the proof is כי לא אחמול עוד. And do not wonder about רועיהם being in the plural, for its like is: ישמח ישראל בעושיו, אם בעליו עמו."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:43.599340475Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}